  "lines": [
    {
      "who": "N",
      "set": "street",
      "text": "September 2007. Thousands of people queue outside a British bank to take their savings out.",
      "gesture": "explain",
      "cam": "wide"
    },
    {
      "who": "N",
      "text": "Nobody robbed it. Nothing was stolen. So why did the bank start to fall apart?",
      "gesture": "explain",
      "cam": "mid:N"
    },
    {
      "who": "V",
      "text": "Alfie! Alfie! Have you seen the news? Our bank is in trouble!",
      "gesture": "panic",
      "cam": "two:A:V",
      "move": {
        "V": {
          "x": 0.7,
          "z": 0.2,
          "yaw": -0.4
        }
      },
      "react": {
        "A": "listen"
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "A",
      "text": "What?! My savings are in there! Everything I have!",
      "gesture": "panic",
      "cam": "close:A",
      "react": {
        "V": "panic"
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "V",
      "text": "Come on, get in the queue before it all runs out!",
      "gesture": "point",
      "cam": "two:A:V",
      "move": {
        "A": {
          "x": -0.5,
          "yaw": 0.3
        },
        "V": {
          "x": 0.2
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "A",
      "set": "bank",
      "text": "Please, I need all my money out. Right now!",
      "gesture": "panic",
      "cam": "two:A:R"
    },
    {
      "who": "R",
      "text": "I'm sorry, Alfie. Your money isn't sitting in a box with your name on it.",
      "gesture": "shrug",
      "cam": "close:R",
      "react": {
        "A": "panic"
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "R",
      "text": "When you save a hundred pounds, we lend most of it to people buying homes. We keep only a little as cash.",
      "gesture": "explain",
      "cam": "mid:R",
      "react": {
        "A": "listen",
        "V": "listen"
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "A",
      "text": "What?! So where is my money?!",
      "gesture": "panic",
      "cam": "close:A",
      "react": {
        "R": "listen"
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "R",
      "text": "In thousands of mortgages. That works perfectly, until everyone asks for it back on the same day.",
      "gesture": "point",
      "cam": "two:A:R",
      "react": {
        "A": "shrug"
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "N",
      "text": "That is a bank run. The longer the queue, the more people panic. And the panic itself becomes the crisis.",
      "gesture": "explain",
      "cam": "wide"
    },
    {
      "who": "N",
      "text": "It happened to Northern Rock. The queues lasted four days, until the government guaranteed savers' money. Within five months, the bank was nationalised.",
      "gesture": "explain",
      "cam": "mid:N"
    },
    {
      "who": "N",
      "set": "calm",
      "text": "Today, UK savings are protected up to a limit by the Financial Services Compensation Scheme. Check the current limit yourself.",
      "gesture": "explain",
      "cam": "wide"
    },
    {
      "who": "A",
      "text": "So... I panicked for nothing?",
      "gesture": "shrug",
      "cam": "close:A"
    },
    {
      "who": "V",
      "text": "Not for nothing. You learned something. Panic is expensive, Alfie.",
      "gesture": "point",
      "cam": "two:A:V",
      "react": {
        "A": "nod"
      }
    },
    {
      "who": "N",
      "text": "Know where your money lives. Stay calm. Check what is protected. This is not financial advice.",
      "gesture": "explain",
      "cam": "mid:N"
    },
    {
      "who": "A",
      "text": "Right. Deep breaths. Fancy a cup of tea?",
      "gesture": "cheer",
      "cam": "two:A:V",
      "react": {
        "V": "cheer"
      }
    }
  ]
}